		"description": "File Extracts (10):\nWithdrawals (nes_withdrawals_DATE)\nCounterfeits (nes_counterfeits _DATE)\nInventory Snapshot (nes_inventory_snapshot_DATE)\nShortage (nes_shortage_DATE)\nOvercap (nes_overcap_DATE)\nCallbacks (merged with nes_shipments)\nRDC Inventories (split in nes_rdc_profile and nes_rdc_profile_details)\nShipments (nes_shipments_DATE)\nNon-Conformances (nes_non_conformances_DATE)\nDeposits (nes_deposits_DATE)",
